{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_wanqin_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_wanqin_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"問道","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_wanqin_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"5df4a693dc1639dd8d79251938531aea700b26a6711e28c0623e43cb8476d1f4","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"傳聞得道仙人隱於密林深處，那仙人極可能是……天師府的老前輩！帶著實驗中遇到的困惑，萬頃踏上了“尋仙問道”之路。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"傳聞得道仙人隱於密林深處。其人有神術，所到之處，雲霧起，從旦至暮。\n雲中之事，虛虛實實，真偽難辨。\n唯求真之本心，可引路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……呼……霧越來越濃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個地方好眼熟，剛剛是不是走過這條路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無人機還是沒有訊號，而且這裡連個能問路的人都沒有……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，山裡的小朋友？你好……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我只是想問路——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小朋友，我不追你，別跑了。山中大霧，容易遇到危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是在讓我跟上她嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g09_teahouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡……是我上山的路。原來我轉了半天，都沒離開這裡多遠……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，快下山，沿著這條路往下走就對了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是要下山。小朋友，我聽說這座山中有一片密林，林子裡有一片耕地，你知道這個地方在哪裡嗎？山中霧氣不散，實在難以辨別道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒見過你說的地方。你一定是聽說了什麼奇奇怪怪的傳聞吧，唉，遊客都這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是傳聞……不僅僅是。對了，我還有很多耕地的照片，你看看，是不是見過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒見過。別什麼都信，聽我的勸告，天黑前離開吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你都沒仔細看……不過確實，拍照的時候你可能都還沒有出生，問你也沒用。不打擾了，我自己繼續找找。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要真有這樣的地方，你不覺得可疑？不通水電，杳無人煙，誰會住在那種地方？不可細想啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那小朋友，你早點回去，天色漸晚，注意安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你還是要往山裡走……你這個人，怎麼聽不懂啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"住在那裡的並不是怪人，是一位經驗豐富的……咦，人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又起霧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"氣象數據說，這裡一年中起霧的天數佔全年的百分之九十。沒時間等霧散了，再碰碰運氣吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無人機……還是沒有訊號。能見度也變得更低了，好詭異，不會真的像那小童說的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，相信科學，相信科學。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這條路……剛才有嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是……什麼地方？我還在剛才的半山腰嗎？嘶——好冷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，這片林子——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"植被分布和地形，與照片裡的林子如出一轍。那前面那片空地一定是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是這片田——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"泛起薄霧的密林中有一片被開墾過的田地。田地邊緣孤零零種著幾株大豆，還有零星一些雜草，附近一大片區域內都沒有積雪覆蓋。\n禾生立刻蹲下來，掏出天師儀測量起那幾株大豆的各項數據，然後與自己不成功的那一批對比了一番。\n末位豆莢的高度完美，且長在背陰的山坡上，植株又耐寒，看來這就是那位老前輩的作品沒錯了。\n禾生激動地跳起來，目光越過田地，找到了在這霧中的唯一一座小木屋。他不假思索地朝那若隱若現的輪廓跑了過去……\n跑過去……\n腳步開始遲疑，再試著走過去……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……咦？瓦罐、松樹盆景、鋤頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，又來了，瓦罐、松樹盆景、鋤頭。一步，兩步，三步，瓦罐、松樹盆景、鋤頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這根本就沒往前走嘛！怎麼回事，和屋子的距離根本沒縮短啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往那邊繞道試試……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，從樹上跳過去呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔哇啊啊啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"禾生試了半天，也走不到那間看似近在眼前的木屋。他垂頭喪氣地在田邊坐了一下子，看田裡的雜草礙眼，順手清理了一番。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……這下看起來舒服多了。好潮濕的天氣，手都快黏在鋤頭上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我就是閒不住。仔細想想接下來該怎麼辦才對……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小朋友，又是你？這麼晚不回家，爸爸媽媽不擔心嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你來求仙問道的話，那就來錯地方了，還是別白費功夫了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——你其實認識那位老前輩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是來求仙，大概算是來問道的吧。他是我的一位未曾謀面的農業天師老前輩，我有重要的事需要向他請教……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的非常重要，困擾了我很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他要好幾年後才會回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你為什麼急著趕我走？現在想起來，剛才在半山腰，你就急著要我離開……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我才沒有！我、我只是不想看你白跑一趟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白跑一趟？老前輩的實驗成果都在這裡呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老前輩讓你傳什麼話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……倒是沒看起來那麼笨嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，他要你……呃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是，那個——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小童努力用手比劃著圓圈，從田地一直指向山下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所求者一如既往，你應該明白了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（田地，畫圈，一如既往。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g11_shuresearchoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這篇論文的作者……去雲遊四海了？！……那有誰知道他的聯絡方式嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不悅的農業天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1248_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你想聯絡他？你不知道這位前輩，當年就嫌棄我們“塵世聒噪”。真是辛苦他忍到完成這篇論文，才遠走高飛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不悅的農業天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1248_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從此他就杳無音訊，誰都不知道他去了哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不悅的農業天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1248_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，是你的哪個課題？非他不可嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我想培養能機械收割又喜陰耐寒的“高莢位二號”，但現在怎麼樣都達不到理想數據，已經卡了半年了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一定有我還沒有注意到的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不悅的農業天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1248_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是有個不尋常的方法可以試試。你去查資料庫……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"農業新聞我都查了一遍，並沒有看到和這位老前輩相關的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不悅的農業天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1248_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我是說，查一查各地的神秘奇聞，說不定會有意外之喜——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，濃茶雖苦但提神，當藥喝了吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——繼續。這麼多奇聞軼事，眼睛都看花了……看到哪一行了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《水怪打水仗事件》、《七彩祥雲竟少了一彩》、《枯井中的炒麵味》……都毫不相關啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《會唱戲的雲獸》？傳給小滿看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《霧中指點迷津的仙人》……出現的日期倒是在那篇論文發表後不久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，這個現場照片！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"禾生湊到螢幕前，將遠距離拍攝的照片放到最大，研究著圖片中央的那一片田地。\n透過雲霧隱約可見地裡生長的作物，禾生仔細地辨別著它們，眼睛越睜越大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老、老師！我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"霧中指點迷津的仙人。\n傳聞源自有人發現某個山頭被不散的祥雲籠罩。\n無人得見仙人真容，走入迷霧卻得其指點迷津，答疑解惑。\n真真假假，虛虛實實，仙人點化，醍醐灌頂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仙人點化……難怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（田地，畫圈，一如既往。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這下我完全明白了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g13_yanlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說你把我的話傳到了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傳、傳到了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你清清楚楚說了，要他滾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多的意思吧哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那他怎麼還在！他還大搖大擺在我田裡犁起地來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……看他用來犁地的那攜帶型小機器，還有他衣服上的銀色紋樣，他和仙人您一樣，也是從天師府來的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“仙人”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您早就看出來了。那人似乎需要您為他答疑解惑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他很有禮貌，所以我也以禮相待，就用手這樣畫著圈，禮貌地示意他滾走……啊，難道他把我的手勢，理解成了您叫他犁地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“仙人”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“仙人”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你聽好，這次你一個字都不許改，如此這般對他說——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"你的課題關我屁事！\n自己的研究自己不會動腦啊？\n腦袋空空就去吃點核桃補腦！滾！\n——前農業天師（《大豆高產技術新方向展望》作者）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你來了？糟糕，都……這麼晚了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"禾生局促地擦了擦汗。乍一看到那小童，他才驚覺，他犁地犁得過分投入了，卻還沒有想出老前輩的這番指點背後的真意。\n此時他就像個忘了做作業被老師抓包的好學生，恨不得鑽進天師儀裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳……仙人說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的課題關他……那個……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"課題？老前輩果然知道我為何而來。然而，剛才的指點，我沒有很好地領悟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道研究不是為了做事而做事，我需要想得更深入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（“你的課題關我屁事”、“腦袋空空就去吃點核桃補腦”，這種話要怎麼說出口啊？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他說，人貴自立。那個……還有，別光待在田間，是時候離開，去補充點營養了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"營養。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是不是，關鍵是前半句，離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離開，去補充營養。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦——這下我確實想明白了，我這就出發！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？你真走？你這就走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，事不宜遲，現在就出發！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜幕與雲霧一道籠罩著山頭，密林中靜謐無聲，直到傳來輕微的腳步聲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"水受到攪動發出的聲響，還有潑灑水的聲音，伴隨著一股異味在雲霧中彌散開來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔……（嗅嗅、嗅嗅）……呃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼聲音……什麼氣味……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是……啊啊啊啊！！！啊啊啊啊啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g13_yanlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個人……那個小夥子，他挑了水回來了，溶解了包肥料，正在施肥啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事……啊，難道是我說的，營養？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“仙人”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼營養？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，可能有一點點怪我……您、您準備怎麼罵他？這次我一定，保證，一字不漏地轉達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“仙人”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……算了，你一個字都無須對他說，把這個給他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是您田裡的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早安，麻煩你又跑一趟，這次老前輩有什麼指示呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……三顆大豆種子？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"禾生看看地裡的大豆，看看手裡的種子，又看看身邊的田地，困惑的眉頭慢慢舒展開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……原來如此，醍醐灌頂。老前輩的意思，我全部明白了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最開始，是因為我無意間鋤了田間的雜草，老前輩便引導我犁地、施肥，做這些，全都是為了這一刻——種下這三顆種子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老前輩是在鼓勵我堅持做下去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝老前輩的指點，這三顆種子，我會結合我所有的知識，認真種下的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？霧氣又變濃了？總、總之，我不會放棄的，老前輩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"禾生躊躇滿志地席地坐下，打開工具包，將他的攜帶式土質檢測儀、無人機、實驗記錄冊、標籤紙、小燒杯等物品一併鋪開在地上。\n完成一切的準備工作後，他從地上抓起了一把土，拿到鼻子前嗅了嗅，在心裡對它說了聲“你好”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一天後"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老前輩，我播完種了，來向您報告今天的各項數據。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，今天霧大，天氣潮濕，容易關節不適，我泡了薑茶讓您暖暖身子。我放在這裡了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩天後"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老前輩，今天是播種後的第二天。我來報告今日數據。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我帶了大荒城的雜糧，幫您和小朋友也熬了粥。薏仁已經煮透軟爛，沒有放糖，您放心喝，不黏牙，也不影響血糖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"六天後"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老前輩，種子能不能發芽，也許明天就能見分曉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，我已失敗半年，並沒有期待這一次就能成功……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我的研究方向一直是錯的，所以我的種子對陽光的需求太高，苗也長不高，機器收割不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，我是想來聽聽老前輩您是怎麼種的。我看到您的田裡有幾株，植株的高度很理想。如果有更多就好了，能帶一些種子回去……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，您的意思是，多想無益？好，我會集中精神，好好完成接下來的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個……我來一字不漏複述仙人的話——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“腦袋裡除了種田還有什麼？要不然你飲露餐風當棵草去吧！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怕你聽不懂，接下來是我自己的補充。小夥子，你是不是忘了件重要的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"數據嗎？稍等我查看一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放下數據——提醒一下，剛開始的時候，你還往仙人那裡送吃的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，糟糕——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別再想了，我是說你這兩天，自己吃飯了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對喔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"七天後"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經進入了大豆種子正常的發芽期。目前，沒有看到發芽的跡象。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"八天後"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"九天後"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g13_yanlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“仙人”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這幾天突然沒聲音了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您還真小心眼，把種不出來的種子給他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“仙人”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要知道，學術界最愛誇他這樣的實心眼。可惜，他看不見一樣東西——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“仙人”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"南牆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山中小童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1643_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，仙人您來回走來走去做什麼，看得我眼睛都花啦。擔心的話，我出去幫您看看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“仙人”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用。撞上了南牆，他就該踏上歸途了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“仙人”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“仙人”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，可不能撞死在我田裡。還是去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"禾生躺在光禿禿的田地裡，手掌貼著土地，靜靜地望著天空。\n他有種奇異的感覺，那座永遠走不到的木屋似乎變得更遠了，消失在了他的視野裡，消失在了霧裡。\n不只是木屋，身邊的一切好像都在遠去。柵欄消失了，樹林也消失了，他的眼裡只剩下這片田地，和頭頂這片天空。\n面朝黃土背朝天，最重要的兩樣東西。\n他似乎能聽到，田裡正在發出細小的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"砰！\n禾生聽到木門被踹開的聲音，回過了神來。他躺在那裡，側過臉，看到從霧裡走出來一位陌生的年輕男子——\n禾生困惑地瞇起眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"種種種，你還在種！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當年老師讓我種第二顆的時候，我就知道種不出來了，該換方向了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你種了這麼多天都沒明白，還要我出來跟你把道理講得明明白白——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可惜我田裡只有幾株大豆？你不想想這麼多年了為什麼只有幾株？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不撞南牆不回頭，做什麼科研都是完……"},{"type":"narration","text":"頗有特色的罵聲在他看到禾生身邊的田地時戛然而止。\n禾生瞪著那個年輕得不像話的……被他叫了十幾天“老前輩”的傢伙。\n而後者瞪著禾生身邊那株冒了頭的大豆苗，歪歪扭扭，嫩生生，但確實出苗了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"禾生望向了天空，霧氣散開了，露出了澄澈的蒼穹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老……呃，前輩，我不確定當一棵草是什麼感覺……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“仙人”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？！這是在罵你死腦筋，不是真的讓你當棵草！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是，如果認真聽的話，好像能聽到——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"種子裡的芽和根，頂破種皮，向外生長的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“仙人”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是你餓暈了！幻覺！起來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是，我真的能聽到……"},{"type":"narration","text":"仙人啪嗒啪嗒打他的臉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"起來！起來，你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別睡了！大水牛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g3_fieldpath"},{"type":"narration","text":"一束大豆葉啪嗒啪嗒地拍著禾生的臉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收豆子的時候，你怎麼能睡啊！快起來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萬一機器從你臉上碾過去怎麼辦！笨水牛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小滿？我……睡著了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫我來看你的“高莢位三號”第一次收割，你自己倒是在偷懶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"機器割大豆不好玩，我看完了，陪我去找綿綿一起玩吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你上次傳給我的《會唱戲的雲獸》，我給綿綿看了，他說他不喜歡唱戲，但是可以試試搖滾樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要不要一起去聽聽？他會很高興的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不去，等收割工作結束了，我還得做數據分析呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真無趣。那我要去告訴黍姐姐，你偷偷在田間睡覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說了也不去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女朝他扮了個鬼臉，一下子就跑得無影無蹤了。\n禾生從大豆田裡站起來。收割機正在田間順暢地運作。他閉上眼傾聽，機械的轟隆聲裡，似乎夾雜著豆莢成熟的聲音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
